  "idle.annoyingvillagers.lay.4": "别踩我，我躺在这儿呢！",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.lay.5": "我没死，只是水平放置了。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.lay.6": "重力又赢了。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.lay.7": "这是我的战术：装死。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.lay.8": "让我安静地躺一会！",
