  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sleep.6": "这是战略性休眠。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sleep.7": "晚安，这残酷的世界。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sleep.8": "我处于潜行模式 (睡觉中)。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sleep.9": "清醒是被高估的状态。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sleep.10": "等到钻石时间再叫醒我。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sleep.11": "你穿全套盔甲睡觉吗？没有？弱爆了。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sleep.12": "如果我打呼噜，那是故意的。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sleep.13": "没错，我睁着一只眼睡觉。",
