  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_sit.2": "我就当没人在看一样坐着。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_sit.3": "我不正常，我在进行“趣坐”。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_sit.4": "感受这增强的氛围。",
