  "idle.annoyingvillagers.slight.16": "那是我打招呼的信号。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.slight.17": "小动作，大能量。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.slight.18": "别眨眼，这种帅气转瞬即逝。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.slight.19": "我用摩斯电码摆表情。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.slight.20": "纯粹魅力的一帧。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.push_up.1": "一！二！呃，谁需要做有氧？",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.push_up.2": "我做俯卧撑是为了给怪物留下印象。",
