  "idle.annoyingvillagers.one_arm_lay_emote.6": "我只需一只胳膊就能这么帅。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.one_arm_lay_emote.7": "只是在雕琢一个随性的杰作。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.one_arm_lay_emote.8": "帅气值很重要，哪怕是在地上。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.one_arm_lay_emote.9": "这是我值得上肖像画的姿势。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.one_arm_lay_emote.10": "放松，精致，略带得意。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.one_arm_lay_emote.11": "单手支撑，全开魅力。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.one_arm_lay_emote.12": "我可以这样睡上几个小时。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.one_arm_lay_emote.13": "这姿势练了很多年。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.one_arm_lay_emote.14": "完美无法一蹴而就。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.one_arm_lay_emote.15": "一半努力，十足美丽。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.one_arm_lay_emote.16": "我自信地休息。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.one_arm_lay_emote.17": "这是高级赖床技巧。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.one_arm_lay_emote.18": "见证舒适手肘的力量。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.one_arm_lay_emote.19": "如果优雅有姿势，那就是这个了。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.one_arm_lay_emote.20": "我让泥土都显得高大上了。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.1": "左手敬礼，同样的尊重。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.2": "精准很重要，不管用哪只手。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.3": "敬礼就是敬礼。看好了。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.4": "形式第一，问题后面再说。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.5": "依然训练有素，只是镜像了一下。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.6": "来自左翼的尊重。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.7": "以风格和平衡致敬。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.8": "左手也值得荣耀。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.9": "不要低估对称的荣誉感。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.10": "正经的敬礼永不过时。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.11": "哪只手我都能表达尊重。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.12": "左手、挺拔、严肃的事业。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.13": "你注意到换手了？很好。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.14": "从新角度看秩序与纪律。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.15": "这个敬礼是百分之百故意的。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.16": "连我的副手看起来都很专业。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.17": "尊重不分左右手。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.18": "试试不帅气地做这个动作，你做不到。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.19": "利落敬礼，稳健精神。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_left_hand_emote.20": "致敬，但稍微偏左一点。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.1": "没武器，没问题。我只是在乘凉。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.2": "看？和平的姿态。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.3": "我把暴力留在家里了。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.4": "双手空空，心如止水。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.5": "罕见的非威胁性能量时刻。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.6": "今天没带剑。只有氛围。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.7": "这是我的徒手谈判姿态。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.8": "我是为了和平而来的……暂时而言。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.9": "手中空无一物，唯有信心。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.10": "放松点，我没打算抡谁。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.11": "这姿势说明我们在进行文明的对话。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.12": "没装备武器，但信任危机满格。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.13": "即使是战士也配拥有安静的坐坐。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.14": "没剑，没弓，只有我。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.15": "暂时不用拎着尖锐物品了。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.16": "这样看起来没那么危险了，对吧？",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.17": "赤手空拳，异常有礼。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.18": "难得一次，谁也没被开瓢。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.19": "这是我的裁军计划。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sit_no_weapon_emote.20": "没装备时的静坐感觉就是不一样。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.1": "有些日子确实比平时沉重。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.2": "我需要静一静……",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.3": "并非每场战斗都能用剑取胜。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.4": "沉默已说明了一切。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.5": "我想念以前那些简单的日子。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.6": "这个世界有时很残酷。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.7": "让我独自思考一会儿。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.8": "再强的心也会累。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.9": "我心中承载太多。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.10": "这不是靠绷带能治好的伤。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.11": "我平时爱笑，但今天笑不出来。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.12": "有些伤口是看不见的。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.13": "我只想要一点安宁。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.14": "感到心碎并不丢人。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.15": "我以为我比这更坚强。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.16": "也许明天会感觉轻松点。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.17": "我还在这里，只是……更安静了。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.18": "不是所有伤痛都会留下痕迹。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.19": "给我一点喘息的时间。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.sorrow_emote.20": "我会再次站起来，只是不是现在。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.1": "行行行！我投降！",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.2": "举起手来！没必要把事情搞僵。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.3": "我今天选择活下去。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.4": "大家都先冷静一下。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.5": "别打了，我认输！",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.6": "仁慈现在听起来是个好词。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.7": "我承认失败。其实还挺开心的。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.8": "看，我手举起来了。这叫诚意。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.9": "比起死，我更想活。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.10": "别把这变成一场悲剧。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.11": "这是我正式放弃的声明。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.12": "你赢了。请别再反复证明了。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.13": "我带着戏剧化的诚实投降了。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.14": "没有花招，没有武器，没有坏主意。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.15": "灵魂的战术性撤退。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.16": "我目前处于反冲突状态。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.17": "大家都放松！尤其是那个在攻击我的家伙。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.18": "我正高调选择和平。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.19": "今天不会有什么英雄式的反击了。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.surrender_emote.20": "行了！我认栽！",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.1": "准备就绪。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.2": "专注并严阵以待。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.3": "等待指令。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.4": "立正！别胡闹。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.5": "挺拔姿态，清晰头脑。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.6": "准备接受检查。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.7": "纪律第一。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.8": "立正，保持全神贯注。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.9": "掌控每一个动作。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.10": "随时准备效劳。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.11": "沉着就是一切。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.12": "稳如磐石，锐如钢铁。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.13": "没有干扰。只有职责。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.14": "目视前方，肩平身正。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.15": "全神贯注，认真聆听。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.16": "到场、专注、准备完毕。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.17": "秩序始于坐姿。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.18": "我在认真听你说话。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.19": "冷静、稳健、待发。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.attention_emote.20": "这就是严阵以待的模样。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.1": "看我华丽的振翅！",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.2": "我称之为“惊弓之鸟”技巧。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.3": "不，我其实不会飞。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.4": "使劲拍！没准这次真行呢。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.5": "当你拥有一颗想飞的时，还要啥尊严？",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.6": "我在测试紧急起飞。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.7": "看我飞起来了！并没有！",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.8": "这两条胳膊已经尽力了。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.9": "我曾在一群很懵逼的鸡手下受训。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.10": "如果热情能当动力，我早飞没影了。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.11": "振翅是一种心态。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.12": "空气动力学是可选配置。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.13": "比起物理定律，我更相信我自己。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.14": "这要么是艺术，要么是崩溃了。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.15": "我离飞黄腾达就差一次拍打了。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.16": "别笑，这是严肃的鸟类业务。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.17": "天空拒绝了我，但我坚持不懈。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.18": "见证命运的扑腾。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.19": "我扑腾故我在。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.flapping_emote.20": "没准我一直拍下去，重力就会跟我道歉。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.1": "喔——！这跳得真爽！",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.2": "有时候你就得蹦跶两下。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.3": "先跳再说，后面再想！",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.4": "这一下小跳治好了我的心情。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.5": "快乐储存在膝盖里。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.6": "看我！我上天了！",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.7": "这就是我庆祝活着的方式。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.8": "离伟大又近了一跳。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.9": "你能听到落地时的喜悦。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.10": "每天一趣跳，烦恼全跑掉。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.11": "我一点也不后悔这一下蹦跶。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.12": "只是给今天加点额外的兴奋点。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.13": "垂直向上的热忱！",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.14": "这一跳很有个性。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.15": "心情：弹簧加压。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.16": "我基本上就是一个开心的史莱姆。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.17": "微小的发射，巨大的氛围。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.18": "这就是休闲物理学。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.19": "跳一下是因为站着太无聊。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.fun_jump_emote.20": "这一跳充满了对心灵伤害的修复。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.1": "我起！",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.2": "干脆利落。简单有效。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.3": "有时高度就是答案。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.4": "快速一跳，头脑清爽。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.5": "永远不要低估扎实的一跃。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.6": "那是教科书级别的。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.7": "正经的跳跃能促进血液循环。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.8": "脚下生风。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.9": "稍微离地一下没啥坏处。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.10": "利落一跳，干净落地。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.11": "动量很重要。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.12": "小小一跃，更好视野。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.13": "只是检查下重力还灵不灵。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.14": "好姿态，好跳跃。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.15": "每一次跳跃都始于决心。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.16": "垂直上升，原路返回。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.17": "一点空气让思绪清晰。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.18": "精准跳跃，毫无多余动作。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.19": "就该这么跳。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.jump_emote.20": "快腿，快跳。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.1": "保持低位，保持存活。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.2": "卧倒姿势。既战术又戏剧化。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.3": "贴地的东西很难被击中。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.4": "这就是巅峰的战场智慧。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.5": "低轮廓，高存活率。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.6": "我没躲。我在进行“战术定位”。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.7": "泥土现在是我的盟友。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.8": "战术煎饼模式：已开启。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.9": "你击不中一个几乎看不见的东西。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.10": "伏地也是一门艺术。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.11": "我更喜欢在地面处理危险。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.12": "扁平、安静、且深思熟虑。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.13": "地面提供了绝佳的掩护。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.14": "这姿势说明我很看重生存。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.15": "有时候最聪明的动作就是向下。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.16": "万一出乱子，我已经准备好了。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.17": "隐蔽始于更低的轮廓。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.18": "随你怎么叫，卧倒或者天才。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.19": "这不是恐惧。这是策略。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.prone_emote.20": "我目前处于水平战术状态。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_emote.1": "敬礼！",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_emote.2": "该有的尊重。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_emote.3": "为了荣誉与职责。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_emote.4": "为庄严时刻送上利落的敬礼。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_emote.5": "昂首挺胸，表达敬意。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_emote.6": "纪律体现在细节中。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_emote.7": "这是一个有目的的敬礼。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_emote.8": "妥善表达的尊重。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_emote.9": "永远不要忘记你的标准。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_emote.10": "荣誉第一。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_emote.11": "稳健的敬礼能说明很多东西。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_emote.12": "利落的姿态，更利落的专注。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_emote.13": "某些时刻值得尊重。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_emote.14": "这个敬礼献给勇敢者。",
  "idle.annoyingvillagers.salute_emote.15": "正式、骄傲且精准。",
